{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119515","id":4461875481,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7cTOSq","number":119515,"title":"🤖 Web: Fix pitch_scale for AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic sample playback","user":{"login":"sergeknystautas","id":706310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjMxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/706310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas","html_url":"https://github.com/sergeknystautas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sergeknystautas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-05-17T01:16:52Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T08:43:28Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T07:50:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119515","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119515","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119515.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119515.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\n`AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic.play_stream()` silently ignores the `pitch_scale` parameter on web exports. Every polyphonic voice plays at 1.0x pitch regardless of the argument. Native builds work correctly.\n\n**Root cause:** On web, polyphonic playback uses `PLAYBACK_TYPE_SAMPLE`, which hands audio to the Web Audio API and bypasses the engine mixer entirely. The `AudioSamplePlayback` object was never given the caller's `pitch_scale` value (defaulting to 1.0), and dynamic updates via `set_stream_pitch_scale()` were never forwarded to the platform audio driver.\n\n**Fix:**\n- Set `sp->pitch_scale = p_pitch_scale` when creating the `AudioSamplePlayback` in `play_stream()`\n- Forward `set_stream_pitch_scale()` calls to `AudioServer::update_sample_playback_pitch_scale()` for sample-based streams\n\nFixes #95850\nRelated: #97704, #94724, #89210, #91605\n\n## Test plan\n\n- Export a project using `AudioStreamPlaybackPolyphonic.play_stream()` with varying `pitch_scale` values to web\n- Verify notes play at correct, distinct pitches (e.g. C major arpeggio: C4, E4, G4, C5)\n- Verify native builds still work correctly (no regression)\n- Verify `set_stream_pitch_scale()` updates pitch dynamically on web\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> *AI disclosure*: This contribution was authored with assistance from an autonomous AI agent, on behalf of a user to fix a confirmed web audio bug.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/claude-code)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119515/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}